    <tags>veida ai image-generator text-to-image cli no-api-key</tags>
    <summary>Generate images from the command line with no API key and no account.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Generate images from the Windows command line, with no API key and no account.

```
veida "an isometric coffee shop, pastel palette"
veida -ratio 16:9 "flat illustration of a rocket leaving a laptop screen"
```

Each command prints a permanent image URL.

It runs on the free tier of [Veida](https://veida.ai/?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=package): 1K output, watermarked, about seven images a day per machine. The exit code is 3 when that allowance is spent and 4 when the content filter refuses the prompt. Signing in on [veida.ai](https://veida.ai/pricing?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=package) removes the watermark and opens models such as [GPT Image 2](https://veida.ai/image/gpt-image-2?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=package).

Libraries for Go, Python, JavaScript, Rust, Ruby, Dart and Java: [github.com/hanshs474/veida-go](https://github.com/hanshs474/veida-go).]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/hanshs474/veida-go/releases/tag/v0.2.0</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
